    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d844">

                <pb facs="0992" n="874" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg874"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00 R 296/2487</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-22"><hi rendition="#italic">November 22,
                        1928</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The French Ambassador asked me on his own responsibility and not for his
                    government as to whether the United States had any objection to Americans being
                    appointed by the foreign governments on the expert committee on reparations. I
                    told him that no government had made any inquiry nor had any citizens of the
                    United States made any inquiry as to whether there was any objection; that all I
                    knew about it was what I had seen in the press; that it was the intention of the
                    Allied Powers and Germany to form an organization of experts to re-examine the
                    subject of German reparations; that it was probable that two American experts
                    would be chosen by them if the United States had no objection. I also said that
                    I had received the same information from our embassies but not by reason of any
                    inquiry made by foreign governments. I told him if any such request was made it
                    would receive sympathetic consideration but that I would have to take the matter
                    up with the President.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">rank</hi>] B. K[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ellogg</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
